In view of the above discussion, we pass the following:
- 20 - NC: 2025:KHC-D:17345-DB HC-KAR ORDER i) The appeal filed by the insurer in MFA No.104712/2023 is allowed in part;
ii) The appeal filed by the claimants in MFA No.101238/2024 is dismissed;
iii) The judgment and award dated 01.09.2023 passed in MVC No.576/2021 on the file of III Additional Senior Civil Judge and Additional MACT, Dharwad is modified;
iv) The claimants are entitled for total compensation of .43,61,000/- instead of .57,89,000/-
along with interest at the rate of 6% p.a. from the date of petition till the date of realization;
v) The respondent No.2-Insurance Company shall deposit compensation amount - 21 - NC: 2025:KHC-D:17345-DB HC-KAR with interest within a period of eight weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
